{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"carefree-submissive-barnacle","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Origin\nExtracted from decision register twofaced-paralytic-elk (9c72-c44a-3421-45ad), which is being dissolved into per-item tickets. Source bug: silt-resistant-gonolek (b0a8-5496-d178-40a9, closed) — standalone concurrency loader cannot import git adapter.\n\n## Decision required (verbatim from the register)\nRaw package-free execution of private `_concurrency.py` regressed at d9e0f0e733 and now raises `ModuleNotFoundError`, but every supported production/library/subprocess route establishes `rebar_reconciler` package context before `applier._load_concurrency()` and succeeds; the caller census found no other route and canonical adapter identity is already singular. Exact decision: must every location-pinned/by-file-loaded reconciler module execute without package context, or only modules that explicitly declare and bootstrap a standalone contract? Recommendation: require context-free execution only for explicitly bootstrapped standalone modules. 'Location-pinned' in ADR 0083 describes filesystem coupling, not a public entry-point promise; `_concurrency.py` is private, says it is inert on its own, and cannot be reached through applier without package context. Under this choice, classify silt-resistant-gonolek as `misunderstanding` / not-a-bug and close without code. If the operator instead wants universal context-free execution, approve that as a new package-wide contract and resume that ticket with the canonical dotted `lazy_load` repair plus an explicit contract test.\n\n## Status\nAwaits an operator design ruling; held at `idea` until ruled.","id":"e5ea-12f3-177b-485a","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["decision-register","debug-sweep"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Design ruling: package-context contract for location-pinned reconciler modules (_concurrency.py)"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787438128512304001,"uuid":"7b185627-b27d-46e3-a75f-d3111d2c8065"}